# D130 and D133: a handler set up in a loop pass keeps that pass's names; a
# handler set up while another handler runs keeps that run's names; a
# function call gives each handler its own names.
create window into app
title of app is "Captures"
names are
    "Ada"
    "Grace"
    "Linus"
for each who in names
    create button into rowButton
    text of rowButton is who
    when rowButton is clicked
        say "loop pass:" who
    .
    put rowButton in app
.
count from 1 to 2 as n
    create button into numbered
    text of numbered is "number " plus "x"
    when numbered is clicked
        say "count pass:" n
    .
    put numbered in app
.

create button into maker
text of maker is "Make one"
made is 0
when maker is clicked
    add 1 to made
    serial is made
    create button into child
    text of child is "child"
    when child is clicked
        say "child of run" serial "now made is" made
    .
    put child in app
    say "made a child, run" serial
.
put maker in app

to addLabeled label
    create button into own
    text of own is label
    when own is clicked
        say "function call:" label
    .
    put own in app
.
addLabeled "From a function"
show app
say "who after the loop:" who
